⍝ countdown: n − 1 each time, round while n − 1 > 0
⸫ ᚠ ⟨ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ ⦃ ⦃ ≶ ○ ⍿⁰ ⊟ △ ⦄ ⥀ ⦃ ⦄ ⍤⥀ ⦄
⍝ count up to a literal bound, measured by the distance left
⸫ ᚢ ⟨ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ ⦃ ⦃ ≶ ⍿¹ △○△ ⊞ △ ⦄ ⥀ ⦃ ⊟ ⧗⁰ △○△ ⧖ ⦄ ⍤⥀ ⦄
⍝ recursion guarded by the face ⊕ of n ≶ 0
⸫ ᚣ ⟨ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ ⦃ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ᚣ ⊟ △ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⋔ ≶ ○ ⍿⁰ ⦃ ⦄ ⍤ᚣ ⦄
⍝ the bound carried on the stack: n i, measured by n − i
⸫ ᚤ ⟨ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ⟩ ⦃ ⌁ ⦃ ≶ ⍿¹ ⍿¹ ⊞ △ ⦄ ⥀ ⦃ ⊟ ⦄ ⍤⥀ ○ ⦄
⦃ △○△ ᚠ ⎙ ○ ᚢ ⎙ △○△ ᚣ ⎙ △○△ ᚤ ⎙ ⦄ ⟨ ⊸ ⟩ ᛟ ⸫
